iB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture three from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-960x958.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-768x766.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70062\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,998\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture three from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_03-960x958.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture four from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-578x580.jpg 578w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-957x960.jpg 957w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-768x770.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04.jpg 997w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70063\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"997,1000\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture four from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_04-957x960.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/abbey_road/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Abbey Road album artwork\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg 721w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"9046\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/abbey_road/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"721,721\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-comments-count=\"2\" data-image-title=\"Abbey Road album artwork\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/abbey_road.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_06/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Picture six from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-580x576.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-960x953.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-768x763.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06.jpg 1000w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"70064\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/alternative-images/alternative-abbey-road_06/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1000,993\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Picture six from the Abbey Road photography session (photo: Iain Macmillan)\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/alternative-abbey-road_06-960x953.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>Macmillan also took a photograph of a nearby tiled street sign for the back cover. The sign has since been replaced, but was situated at the corner of Abbey Road and Alexandra Road. The junction no longer exists; the road was later replaced by the Abbey Road housing estate, between Boundary Road and Belsize Road.</p><p>On 22 May 2012 one of the outtakes from the photography session <a href=\"/2012/05/22/abbey-road-outtake-photograph-sells-for-16000/\">sold at auction in London for £16,000 ($25,000)</a>.</p><figure id=\"attachment_109003\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-109003\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><a href=\"/gallery/1969-photos/690807-08-mccartney-diary/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-109003\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4MDAiIGhlaWdodD0iNTAxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgODAwIDUwMSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"109003\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1969-photos/690807-08-mccartney-diary/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1426,893\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s diary, 7-8 August 1969\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"<p>Paul McCartney&amp;#8217;s diary, 7-8 August 1969</p>\n\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-960x601.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-960x601.jpg\" alt=\"Paul McCartney's diary, 7-8 August 1969\" width=\"800\" height=\"501\" class=\"size-large wp-image-109003\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-960x601.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-580x363.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-200x125.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-768x481.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary-190x120.jpg 190w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/690807-08-mccartney-diary.jpg 1426w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-109003\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Paul McCartney’s diary, 7-8 August 1969</figcaption></figure>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 8 August 2024</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2019: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2019/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-ryman-auditorium-nashville-5/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Ryman Auditorium, Nashville</a></li><li>2019: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2019/08/08/abbey-road-50th-anniversary-reissue/\">The Beatles announce Abbey Road 50th anniversary reissue</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/08/08/paul-mccartney-live-air-canada-centre-toronto-3/\">Paul McCartney live: Air Canada Centre, Toronto</a></li><li>2009: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2009/08/08/beatles-fans-mark-40-years-of-abbey-road-photoshoot/\">Beatles fans mark 40 years of Abbey Road photoshoot</a></li><li>2003: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2003/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-van-andel-arena-grand-rapids/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Van Andel Arena, Grand Rapids</a></li><li>1998: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1998/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-heitere-open-air-zofingen/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Heitere Open Air, Zofingen</a></li><li>1995: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1995/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-palace-theatre-louisville/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Palace Theatre, Louisville</a></li><li>1992: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1992/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-ace-bowen-concert-grounds-camp-pendleton/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Ace Bowen Concert Grounds, Camp Pendleton</a></li><li>1989: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1989/08/08/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-merriweather-post-pavilion-columbia/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Merriweather Post Pavilion, Columbia</a></li><li>1980: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1980/08/08/recording-borrowed-time-kiss-kiss-kiss-nobody-told-me-john-lennon-yoko-ono/\">Recording: Borrowed Time, Kiss Kiss Kiss, Nobody Told Me by John Lennon and Yoko Ono</a></li><li>1977: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1977/08/08/recording-mixing-editing-mull-of-kintyre-girls-school-wings/\">Recording, mixing, editing: Mull Of Kintyre, Girls School by Wings</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/08/08/recording-all-by-myself-ringo-starr/\">Recording: All By Myself by Ringo Starr</a></li><li>1972: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1972/08/08/wings-live-idrottshuset-orebro/\">Wings live: Idrottshuset, Örebro</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/08/08/recording-the-end-i-want-you-shes-so-heavy-oh-darling/\">Recording: The End, I Want You (She’s So Heavy), Oh! Darling</a></li><li>1968: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1968/08/08/recording-mixing-hey-jude-not-guilty/\">Recording, mixing: Hey Jude, Not Guilty</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/08/08/south-african-broadcasting-corporation-bans-beatles-music/\">The South African Broadcasting Corporation bans The Beatles’ music</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/08/08/us-lp-revolver/\">US album release: Revolver</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/08/08/us-single-eleanor-rigby-yellow-submarine/\">US single release: Eleanor Rigby/Yellow Submarine</a></li><li>1963: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/08/08/live-candie-gardens-guernsey/\">The Beatles live: Candie Gardens, Guernsey</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/08/08/live-co-op-ballroom-doncaster/\">The Beatles live: Co-op Ballroom, Doncaster</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/08/08/live-cavern-club-liverpool-30/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=4da2e9258556b9b668bbd5d0c19e6ab5&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=3218&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "All four Beatles gathered at EMI Studios on the morning of Friday 8 August 1969 for one of the most famous photo shoots of their career. Photographer Iain Macmillan took the iconic image that adorned the front of their last-recorded album, Abbey Road. Here is a photograph taken earlier in August 1969, showing the empty crossing.Iain Macmillan was a freelance photographer and a friend to John Lennon and Yoko Ono. He used a Hasselblad camera with a 50mm lens, aperture f22, at 1/500 seconds.Prior to the shoot, Paul McCartney had sketched his ideas for the cover, to which Macmillan added a more detailed illustration.As the group waited outside the studio for the shoot to begin, Linda McCartney took a number of extra photographs.A policeman held up the traffic as Macmillan, from a stepladder positioned in the middle of the road, took six shots as the group walked across the zebra crossing just outside the studio.The Beatles crossed the road a number of times while Macmillan photographed them. 8 August was a hot day in north London, and for four of the six photographs McCartney walked barefoot; for the other two he wore sandals.#OTD 1969, Abbey Road cover shoot: 'We're meant to be recording, not posing for Beatle pictures'- that's what we were thinking\" – John pic.twitter.com/pspiOfUnyh— The Beatles (@thebeatles) August 8, 2017Shortly after the shoot, McCartney studied the transparencies and chose the fifth one for the album cover. It was the only one when all four Beatles were walking in time. It also satisfied The Beatles’ desire for the world to see them walking away from the studios they had spent so much of the last seven years inside.\n\n\n\n\n\nMacmillan also took a photograph of a nearby tiled street sign for the back cover. The sign has since been replaced, but was situated at the corner of Abbey Road and Alexandra Road. The junction no longer exists; the road was later replaced by the Abbey Road housing estate, between Boundary Road and Belsize Road.On 22 May 2012 one of the outtakes from the photography session sold at auction in London for £16,000 ($25,000).Paul McCartney’s diary, 7-8 August 1969\nPage last updated: 8 August 2024Also on this day...2019: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Ryman Auditorium, Nashville2019: The Beatles announce Abbey Road 50th anniversary reissue2010: Paul McCartney live: Air Canada Centre, Toronto2009: Beatles fans mark 40 years of Abbey Road photoshoot2003: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Van Andel Arena, Grand Rapids1998: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Heitere Open Air, Zofingen1995: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Palace Theatre, Louisville1992: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Ace Bowen Concert Grounds, Camp Pendleton1989: Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Merriweather Post Pavilion, Columbia1980: Recording: Borrowed Time, Kiss Kiss Kiss, Nobody Told Me by John Lennon and Yoko Ono1977: Recording, mixing, editing: Mull Of Kintyre, Girls School by Wings1974: Recording: All By Myself by Ringo Starr1972: Wings live: Idrottshuset, Örebro1969: Recording: The End, I Want You (She’s So Heavy), Oh! Darling1968: Recording, mixing: Hey Jude, Not Guilty1966: The South African Broadcasting Corporation bans The Beatles’ music1966: US album release: Revolver1966: US single release: Eleanor Rigby/Yellow Submarine1963: The Beatles live: Candie Gardens, Guernsey1962: The Beatles live: Co-op Ballroom, Doncaster1961: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)Want more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
